smb: client: split out smbd_ib_post_send()

jira KERNEL-1677
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-5.14.0-687.52.1.el9_8
commit-author Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>
commit bf30515caec590316e0d08208e4252eed4c160df
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-5.14.0-687.52.1.el9_8/bf30515c.failed

This is like smb_direct_post_send() in the server
and will simplify porting the smbdirect_send_batch
and credit related logic from the server.

